        <div class="tpl-body">Children traveling with one parent, or someone who is not a parent/legal guardian, or children traveling internationally without both parents may be required to carry a notarized consent letter and additional documentation depending on the destination and airline. Please check specific entry requirements well in advance and reach out if you'd like help confirming what's needed for your trip.</div>
